	(descr "Kinghelm KH-TYPE-C-W.SMT-16P USB-C receptacle, LCSC C2688791. Shell tabs are SMD (no through-hole legs); two 0.65mm NPTH holes take the plastic locating pegs. Mouth at +Y (y=5.05); on this board the mouth sits 1.5 mm past the board edge, so the front silk ticks were dropped. Pads A4/A9/B1/B12 shortened 0.08 mm at the front end to keep 0.25 mm from the peg holes. Pad geometry from the LCSC/EasyEDA model via the JLC MCP.")
